									"documentation": "The CTC office service and the one implementation of ICTCService. Owns the CtcSystemState, validates and queues schedules, dispatches trains when SystemTime reaches their departure time, re-plans released trains, and delegates routing, speed, authority, movement-plan timing and location inference to the stateless planners. Knows nothing about the transport: every outbound message goes through the injected IMessageSender.",
